# Recorded input for the select example page (widgets/select.zig, `Example`), at 800 x 600 in
# the default theme: the select at x 58..178, y 8..42; its open list at x 58..178, y 48..143:
# Circle (y 51..81), Square (81..110), Triangle (110..140), x 61..175. One line per frame says
# what it does (format: input.Replay). Keys are USB HID: 81 Down, 40 Enter, 41 Escape.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 800 600
dt 0.016
pointer 400 300
# 1: press the select
frame
pointer 118 25
buttons left
# 2: release: the list opens on Circle, the value
frame
buttons
# 3: Down: Square
frame
press 81
